    "detailed_description": "<strong>FLESHLESS</strong> is an innovative fixed-camera puzzle-solving exploration platformer that has a compelling narrative. <br>Players are immersed in an abstract world, tasked with unraveling its intricacies and uncovering hidden secrets. <br>Will you successfully figure out who you are and where you are, or will you relegate to obscurity like countless others before you? <br>This project seamlessly melds abstract artistry with gaming experience, resulting in a unique and captivating product.<br><br>Movement: Utilize the WASD keys to navigate your character within the game environment.<br>Interaction: Press the 'E' key to activate various interactive elements such as levers, cogs, and other objects essential for progression and puzzle-solving.",
